<title>UK: UK film and tv 1995 overseas earnings, payments up.</title>
<headline>UK film and tv 1995 overseas earnings, payments up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overseas receipts generated by Britain's film and television industry were 10 percent higher in 1995 than in the previous year, the Office for National Statistics said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The British film and television industry gathered receipts totalling 908 million stg last year but overseas payments shot up by 29 percent to 999 million stg.</p>
<p>That left a net deficit for the industry of 91 million stg, following a surplus of 50 million in 1994.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
